{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6e911eba808afe83","name":"Conspiracy","source":{"id":"source:reference-6e911eba808afe83","title":"Conspiracy","revision":20609,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:10:51Z","sha256":"131ebf2c6623c619a9785208d9d97236fd2ae7f25bb0732f8f1d0bf2b0e71528","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20609","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Conspiracy&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6e911eba808afe83","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You witnessed an attempt to cover up an incredible secret and had to abandon your life for fear that the conspirators would try to silence you. Perhaps you managed to sneak past the Imperial blockade after ",{"tag":"a","children":["Falleen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Falleen","referenceId":"reference:44445ed6fcb3afd6"}," was quarantined and you learned what really happened there, or maybe you saw the assassination of a local Moff by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Sun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Sun","referenceId":"reference:5c22b34bff28e06d"}," hit squad. The event that you witnessed was significant enough to justify your fear of retribution, and perhaps it provides you with the motivation to see that the conspirators are brought to justice.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Relevant Skills:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Enhancement:"]}," As a result of trying to avoid the conspirators for so long, you have learned to spot the signs of a conspiracy. You can reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Deception"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Influence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Influence"},", keeping the better result.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
